    },
    {
      "id": "cwHdZ",
      "text": "\n$100 \\mathrm{~sec}$ and $150 \\mathrm{~sec}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For discharging of an RC circuit,\n$V=V_0 e^{-t / \\tau}$\nSo, when\n$V=\\frac{V_0}{2}$\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{V}_0}{2}=\\mathrm{V}_0 \\mathrm{e}^{-\\mathrm{t} / \\tau}$\n$\\ln \\frac{1}{2}=-\\frac{\\mathrm{t}}{\\tau} \\Rightarrow \\tau=\\frac{\\mathrm{t}}{\\ln 2}$\nFrom graph when $\\mathrm{V}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}_0}{2}, \\mathrm{t}=100 \\mathrm{~s} \\quad \\therefore \\tau=\\frac{100}{\\ln 2}=144.3 \\mathrm{~sec}$",
    "image": null
  },
